  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3044,
      "text": "He said, “What knowledge do I have of what they do?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 112,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3045,
      "text": "Their reckoning is only with my Lord if you realize!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 113,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3046,
      "text": "I am not going to drive the believers away.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 114,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3047,
      "text": "I am only a clear warner.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 115,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3048,
      "text": "They said, “O Noah, if you do not desist, you will certainly be stoned.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 116,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3049,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, my people have rejected me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 117,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3050,
      "text": "So judge between me and them decisively, and save me and the believers who are with me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 118,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3051,
      "text": "So We saved him and those who were with him in the fully laden Ark.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 119,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3052,
      "text": "Then We drowned thereafter all the rest.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 120,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3053,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a sign in this, yet most of them would not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 121,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3054,
      "text": "Indeed, your Lord is the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 122,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 321,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3055,
      "text": "The people of ‘Ād rejected the messengers",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 123,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3056,
      "text": "when their brother Hūd said to them, “Will you not fear Allah?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 124,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3057,
      "text": "I am a trustworthy messenger to you,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 125,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3058,
      "text": "so fear Allah, and obey me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 126,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3059,
      "text": "I do not ask you for any reward for this; my reward is only with the Lord of the worlds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 127,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3060,
      "text": "Do you build a landmark[17] on every high place for no purpose?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 128,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3061,
      "text": "And do you construct for yourselves palaces, hoping that you will live forever?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 129,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3062,
      "text": "And when you attack [others], do you attack ruthlessly?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 130,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3063,
      "text": "So fear Allah, and obey me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 131,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3064,
      "text": "And fear the One Who has provided you with everything you know:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 132,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3065,
      "text": "Who provided you with livestock and children,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 133,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3066,
      "text": "and with gardens and springs.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 134,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3067,
      "text": "I fear for you the punishment of a momentous day.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 135,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 372,
      "ruku": 322,
      "hizbQuarter": 149,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3068,
      "text": "They said, “It is the same to us whether you admonish us or not.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
